# HRPN design-system fixtures — manifest

Acceptance fixtures for the design-system packages `diagram-core` / `diagram-canvas` (profile `generic@1`): the four HRPN
architecture scenes as entities and relations, with no coordinates (the design system computes the layout). Generated by
`build-fixtures.mjs` (do not edit by hand). No git commit: consumers take each file by path + sha256.

## Generator

```sh
node docs/architecture/hrpn/ds-fixtures/build-fixtures.mjs   # from the repository root; Node only
```

Checks run by the generator: counts per scene equal the `build-scenes.mjs` output (`.generated/data.json`); sceneHash
(build-scenes projection) equals data.json and the PNG `figures.json`; unique ids; relation endpoints are cards; parents
are zones; closed tint set; S2-target clean (no removed, no risk, no dashed link) and 51 cards / 54 links; generic@1 limits
(unique container names, <= 64 containers, name <= 200, link label <= 120); no geometry key in any fixture; draw.io page
per scene with the scene title.

