Fixture fields: `entities[]` {id, kind `card`|`zone`, label, detail, parent (zone id or null), tint, code, role, name, footer,
store}; `relations[]` {id, from, to, label, style `solid`|`dashed`}; `zoneHierarchy` {rootCards, zones[] {id, label, cards, zones}};
`profileMapping` maps them to generic@1 (`node`, `container`, `contains`, `link`).

